  "economy.showEarn": "Faaite i te eʻa noaa",
  "economy.showEarnSub": "A ta'aro i te mau aroraa, a noaa i te moni ta'aro",
  "economy.todayHead": "Te mea vai i teie nei",
  "economy.todayLead": "O te mau taahiraa tino e paruru e te mau tuhi paruru a te api LOADOUT (0.6.0) te faaite i te huru haamaitairaa e faanehenehe ta te faanavairaa moni e opua e horoa.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "No te mea e faaohipahia ta'na moni no te aufau ia rātou. E haamata te ta'aro na te AI taatoa ia vai ai, e na te feia hamani utuhia e taui i te ʻohipa a te AI, ma te faaitehia ta rātou i'oa.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "E nehenehe te ta'aro na te Internet?",
  "faq.freePlay": "E ta'aro noa anei?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Mau uiraa",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Aita ano. E ʻohipa te ta'aro rave rau taata LAN i nia i te tuhaa hoê i teie nei (mai te 0.2.0); aita te ta'aro na te Internet i hamanihia.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Ua hamanihia te tamataraa i nia i te mātini puna matara Quake III Arena (GPL) e ua rave i te mau pahī no Elite Dangerous ei faaitoitoraa. I te piti o te mahana, ua tuuhia te code o te ta'aro i nia i BuB, hoê mātini apî i papaʻihia ma Claude Code; ua tae mai te mau tuhaa ta'aro mai te tamataraa e ua taui-ʻia te i'oa. Na te neneiraa 0.3.0 i horoa i te mau huru pahī 16 atoa i te mau tino apî. Te hiʻopoʻahia nei te hoê hiʻopoʻaraa parau faatia, ia ite mai ia vai noa te tahi code i tupu mai i te mea GPL matamua e ia ite mai ia fatata roa te mau hohoʻa pahī matamua i to rātou faaitoitoraa. Ua rave-ʻia te hoê hiʻoraa-faaauraa aitoma i te code i nia i te puna o te tamataraa GPL i te <0/>, e te hiʻopoʻaraa a te feia ite i te mau mea i itehia te haere nei. Te mea atoa i tupu mai, e papaʻihia faahou aore ra e faahohoʻa-faahouhia. I mua i te oti o te hiʻopoʻaraa, aita mātou e parau e aita.",
  "faq.questions": "Mau uiraa",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Mau pahī, mau hohoʻa, api faaohipa e te tahi atu, ia faatia te moni. <0>Te buka tauiraa i nia i teie api<\/0> te papaʻi i te tuhaa tataitahi e e faaite i te taui tataitahi e ta'na feia hamani.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Ua faanahohia ia noaa te mau pahī e te mau haamaitairaa na roto i te ta'aro aore ra ia hoʻohia. Te huru e ora ai te mau pahī utuhia ma te tiʻa i roto i te aroraa taata e te taata, te faanahohia ra ia.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "O te opuaraa ïa: e ta'aro noa, ma te moni ta'aro e te mau faanehenehe e maitihia. Aita ano i hamanihia.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ua faahohoʻa-ʻia anei te ʻohipa a te tahi taata?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Anafea e tae mai ai, e i nia i te aha?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Eaha te mau tuhaa e taui te taata, e e nafea au i te ite?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "No te aha e tauturu ai te ta'aro hamanihia e te AI i te feia hamani?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "E hoʻo anei no te upootia?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Aita ano e mahana tuuraa e e hoʻoraa.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude e Claude Code e tapa hoʻo ïa na Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine e Epic Games e tapa hoʻo ïa na Epic Games, Inc. Blender e tapa hoʻo ïa na te Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena e Elite Dangerous e tapa hoʻo ïa no to rāua mau fatu. Na te mau fatu te mau i'oa atoa e faaohipahia noa no te faataa i te mau hoʻo i faahitihia. Aita o Orion-81 e taati, e turu-ʻia aore ra e farii-ʻia e hoê o rātou.",
